That message is not surprising.  When you are carrying the Amulet you
cannot level-teleport.  Not with traps or scrolls.  You *can* be
raised by a cursed potion of gain level, however.

As for your being stuck; you are currently on the top level of Vlad's
Tower.  If you haven't yet, you will discover that each of those rooms
contains a vampire.  Go back down two levels and find the other set of
up stairs in the upper left corner.

>All the walls around me are too hard to dig using a wand or a pick
>axe, and a mysterious force prevents me from teleporting. I have one
>charge left on my wand of wishing, polymorph control, wand of
>polymorph. I've tried polymorphing into anything that might get
>through the walls (rock mole, umber hulk, energy vortex,etc) I've
>tried wishing for jumping boots, but you can't jump past walls.

If you're dead set on not backtracking, you could polymorph yourself
into a Xorn and simply phase through the walls.

>What am I to do ? 
>By the way, I wore the Amulet of Yendor, has this done anything to me ?
>Is this a bad idea ?

Not really.  It doesn't convey any abilities to you that you wouldn't
get by simply carrying it.  Remove it and put on one that might do you
some good, like an amulet of life saving.

